<title>UK: Citibank sets warrants on LIFFE contracts.</title>
<headline>Citibank sets warrants on LIFFE contracts.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank, N.A in New York has issued 30 American-style tranches of put and call warrants on LIFFE future contracts, lead manager Citibank said.</p>
<p>There are 14 tranches on LIFFE-Bund-Future with a spot reference of 99.61 percent, eight tranches on LIFFE-JGB-Futures with a spot reference of 124.79 percent and eight tranches on LIFFE-BTP-Futures with a spot reference of 127.73 percent.</p>
<p>The warrants have a payment date of January 17, 1997, there is a minimum exercise of 100 warrants and they will be listed in Dusseldorf and Frankfurt.</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
